<title>POLAND: KABLE 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KABLE 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.21 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.20 vs   1.58</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.31 vs   1.82</p>
<p> Sales		   10.03 vs  14.50</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.50 vs   6.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.52 vs   6.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.15 vs   7.19</p>
<p> Sales		  132.71 vs 121.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Slaska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
